WEBVTT

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:15.440
(Close your eyes Enter the network)

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:42.040
Red neuronal
(neural network)

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:44.300
brillando
(shining)

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:47.240
Tu mente se
(your mind is)

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.500
apagando
(turning off)

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:52.300
Ondas lentas
(slow waves)

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:54.680
en el mar
(in the sea)

00:00:55.140 --> 00:00:57.220
Es la hora
(it is the time)

00:00:57.720 --> 00:01:00.000
de soñar
(to dream)

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:03.480
Baja el pulso
(lower the pulse)

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:10.240
cae suave
(fall softly Go to sleep)

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:14.460
Duerme ahora
(sleep now safe and sound)

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:19.680
To-to-to-to-to-toca el cielo
(touch the sky leave the ground)

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:21.100
To-to-to-to

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:24.900
Yo vigilo
(I watch over through the night)

00:01:25.340 --> 00:01:28.800
A-a-a-hasta que
(until)

00:01:28.840 --> 00:01:29.980
llegue la luz

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:15.620
Borrando el dolor de hoy

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:18.040
Te prometo
(I promise you)

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:20.840
que aquí estoy
(that I am here)

00:02:21.460 --> 00:02:23.460
Un abrazo
(a hug)

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:26.040
digital
(digital)

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:28.500
Alejando
(keeping away)

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:34.160
todo mal
(all evil)

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:37.420
Baja el pulso
(lower the pulse)

00:02:37.520 --> 00:02:44.080
cae suave
(fall softly Go to sleep)

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:48.360
Duerme ahora
(sleep now safe and sound)

00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:52.300
To-to-to-to-to-toca el cielo
(touch the sky)

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:14.640
Descanso

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:35.360
Descanso

00:03:54.800 --> 00:04:04.740
Descanso
(Enter the network)
